{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"alias":"restless-citrine-beagle","creation_channel":"cli","description":"## Context\nFound while calibrating the 6754 config-read gate: CodeHealthConfig.analyzers (src/rebar/_config_schema.py:467) has a coercion entry and a dataclass field but NO cfg read site anywhere in src/rebar — _commands/metrics.py consumes scan_roots/size_cap/size_near_fraction but never .analyzers. The knob silently does nothing (inert-config class, 281f/9d7a family).\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] Either wire analyzers selection into the metrics pipeline or remove the field + coercion row.\n- [ ] The 6754 gate's read-via marker for this field is removed once resolved.","id":"dce2-b93d-4112-451c","parent_id":"","priority":2,"tags":[],"ticket_type":"bug","title":"CodeHealthConfig.analyzers is inert: zero read sites outside config plumbing"},"env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","event_type":"CREATE","timestamp":1785721968227615001,"uuid":"ee9167f7-cab6-41f8-ad0d-24dae743513f"}